-- Shared fixture. Included by each test inside its own transaction (rolled back).
-- Inserted as the connecting superuser, which bypasses RLS; the tests then SET ROLE
-- spms_app so every assertion runs under the policies the API runs under.
--
--   tenant A: properties A1, A2      tenant B: property B1
\set ON_ERROR_STOP 1

